  "body": "As you enter this gorgeous home,  head upstairs to light, bright, easy living on an unexpected scale. Sun pours into the modern open-plan kitchen and dining area, as well as your lounge, all flowing out to the large sheltered entertainers' and sun worshippers' deck. Perfect for al fresco dinner parties, long lazy lunches, or catching a few rays.\r\n\r\nDownstairs are two double bedrooms plus either a single bedroom or study. A large, modern bathroom with both a bath and a shower also houses the laundry. Step directly out to the private garden oasis. The landscaped easy care tropical garden with lush lawn is neither too big, nor too small, it is just right.  With a single lock-up garage and covered carport, there's room for two cars. \r\n\r\nThis could be the perfect apartment alternative or lock-and-leave residence for executives, small families, or singles, with or without a fur baby. The exceptional location completes the package. Within walking distance of superb schools, St Heliers Bay Village, and the waterfront, with easy access to public transport.\r\n\r\nOur vendors have purchased and are moving south.",
